		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">In May&#160;2021, the Company purchased a <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c176" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">10</ix:nonFraction>% equity interest in Dai Cheong Trading Inc., a grocery trading company, for $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c177" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TradingGainsLosses" scale="0" unitRef="usd">162,665</ix:nonFraction> from DC Holding CA, Inc. DC Holding CA, Inc. is owned by John Xu, the Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of the Company.</p>
		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">In December&#160;2021, the Company purchased a <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c80" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">10</ix:nonFraction>% equity interest in HKGF Market of Alhambra, Inc., the legal entity holding the Alhambra store for $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c328" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionAmountsOfTransaction" scale="0" unitRef="usd">40,775</ix:nonFraction> from Ms. Grace Xu, a related party as the spouse of Mr.&#160;John Xu, the Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of the Company.</p></ix:continuation>
		</div>

